{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10 <strong>Interfuse</strong> \u2013 <i>Your Gateway to Real-Time Game Integration</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interfuse</strong> is a powerful, modular application designed to connect your favorite games with external platforms like <strong>Twitch</strong>, <strong>Discord</strong>, or custom hardware\u2014using <strong>OSC</strong>, <strong>UDP</strong>, and <strong>TCP</strong> protocols. All through an intuitive visual interface that makes setting up interactions simple, flexible, and fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Example Plugin: Twitch \u2192 VRChat OSC</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your viewers control your VRChat avatar in real time via Twitch chat, channel points, or other events! With this plugin, you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Trigger emotes or animations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Change facial expressions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Activate avatar toggles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 And more\u2014all using <strong>OSC</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce1 <strong>Built for Creators, Devs, and Streamers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a VTuber, modder, game developer, or interactive streamer, Interfuse gives you the freedom to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Send and receive data over <strong>OSC, UDP, and TCP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Build custom interactions using a sleek node-based interface</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Connect multiple devices, apps, and services together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Extend support to new games and systems with ease</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Create and Share</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your own plugins. Support other games. Build for niche tools. Share your integrations with the world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3835420?t=1758482087","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3835420?t=1758482087","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835420/4a730efd07c8cd94cfd9ad41b90a65c91b41a45d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758482087","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835420/4a730efd07c8cd94cfd9ad41b90a65c91b41a45d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758482087","categories":[{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10 <strong>Interfuse</strong> \u2013 <i>Your Gateway to Real-Time Game Integration</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interfuse</strong> is a powerful, modular application designed to connect your favorite games with external platforms like <strong>Twitch</strong>, <strong>Discord</strong>, or custom hardware\u2014using <strong>OSC</strong>, <strong>UDP</strong>, and <strong>TCP</strong> protocols. All through an intuitive visual interface that makes setting up interactions simple, flexible, and fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Example Plugin: Twitch \u2192 VRChat OSC</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your viewers control your VRChat avatar in real time via Twitch chat, channel points, or other events! With this plugin, you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Trigger emotes or animations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Change facial expressions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Activate avatar toggles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 And more\u2014all using <strong>OSC</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\